/* 项目详情（Figma 666:2798）：标题与边界、参与前先了解、项目记录节奏（研究角色）、小节切换、本节练习、已提交记录、练习依据。 */
.pd-page {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--p3-section);
  padding-top: 16rpx;
  padding-bottom: calc(72rpx + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
}

.pd-head,
.pd-card,
.pd-block,
.pd-titles,
.pd-session-head,
.pd-list,
.pd-slider,
.pd-meta {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}

.pd-head {
  gap: var(--p3-stack);
}

.pd-card {
  gap: var(--p3-stack);
  padding: var(--p3-card);
  border-radius: var(--p3-radius-card);
  background: var(--p3-surface);
}

.pd-card__head {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: var(--p3-tight);
}

.pd-titles {
  flex: 1 0 0;
  gap: 4rpx;
  min-width: 0;
}

.pd-meta,
.pd-list,
.pd-session-head {
  gap: 8rpx;
}

.pd-body {
  color: var(--p3-ink);
  font-size: 30rpx;
  line-height: 52rpx;
}

.pd-body--muted {
  color: var(--p3-muted);
}

.pd-accent {
  color: var(--p3-primary);
  font-size: 26rpx;
  line-height: 40rpx;
}

.pd-list__item {
  color: var(--p3-ink);
  font-size: 28rpx;
  line-height: 44rpx;
}

.pd-help {
  align-self: flex-start;
  width: auto;
  height: auto;
  min-height: var(--safe-touch, 88rpx);
  padding: 0;
}

.pd-points {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}

.pd-session-done {
  font-size: 26rpx;
}

/* 本节练习：块之间 12，块内 8 */
.pd-block {
  gap: var(--p3-tight);
}

.pd-step {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: var(--p3-tight);
}

.pd-step__index {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  width: 48rpx;
  height: 48rpx;
  margin-top: 2rpx;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--p3-soft);
  color: var(--p3-primary);
  font-size: 26rpx;
  line-height: 40rpx;
}

.pd-step__text {
  flex: 1 0 0;
  min-width: 0;
  color: var(--p3-ink);
  font-size: 30rpx;
  line-height: 52rpx;
}

.pd-paper {
  padding: 24rpx 28rpx;
  border-radius: var(--p3-radius-group);
  background: var(--p3-paper);
}

.pd-paper__text {
  color: var(--p3-ink);
  font-size: 28rpx;
  line-height: 44rpx;
}

/* 书写提示用宋体引语（UIproduct3/Quote 17/28） */
.pd-prompt {
  font-size: 34rpx;
  line-height: 56rpx;
}

/* 我的书写：多行文本框（P3/Field Multi，高 128）；测试要求类名保持 draft-input */
.draft-input {
  box-sizing: border-box;
  width: 100%;
  height: 256rpx;
  padding: 24rpx 28rpx;
  border: 2rpx solid var(--p3-control);
  border-radius: 28rpx;
  background: var(--p3-surface);
  color: var(--p3-ink);
  font-size: 30rpx;
  line-height: 52rpx;
}

.pd-closing {
  color: var(--p3-primary);
  font-size: 30rpx;
  line-height: 52rpx;
}

.pd-notes {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 8rpx;
  padding: 24rpx 28rpx;
  border-radius: var(--p3-radius-group);
  background: var(--p3-paper);
  color: var(--p3-muted);
  font-size: 26rpx;
  line-height: 40rpx;
}

.submit-block {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--p3-stack);
}

.pd-chips {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: var(--p3-tight);
}

.pd-slider {
  gap: var(--p3-tight);
}

.pd-slider__label {
  color: var(--p3-ink);
  font-size: 28rpx;
  line-height: 44rpx;
}

.pd-notice-action {
  margin-top: 8rpx;
}

.pd-history {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: var(--p3-tight);
  padding-top: 16rpx;
  border-top: 2rpx solid var(--p3-hairline);
}

.pd-history__copy {
  display: flex;
  flex: 1 0 0;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 4rpx;
  min-width: 0;
}

.pd-history__title {
  color: var(--p3-ink);
  font-size: 28rpx;
  line-height: 44rpx;
}

.pd-history__text {
  display: -webkit-box;
  overflow: hidden;
  -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
  -webkit-line-clamp: 2;
}

.pd-evidence {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 4rpx;
  padding-top: 16rpx;
  border-top: 2rpx solid var(--p3-hairline);
}

.pd-evidence__practice {
  color: var(--p3-ink);
  font-size: 28rpx;
  line-height: 44rpx;
  font-weight: 500;
}

.pd-evidence__finding {
  color: var(--p3-muted);
  font-size: 28rpx;
  line-height: 44rpx;
}

.pd-evidence__citation {
  color: var(--p3-muted);
  font-size: 24rpx;
  line-height: 36rpx;
  overflow-wrap: anywhere;
}
